description=v3.6.3 the Recents tap is handed over the moment the finger lifts: the tap watcher no longer reads the event stream through awk, whose input buffering held the tap until the stream ended - a phone's stream never ends, so v3.6.2's watcher watched forever and never acted. The tap state machine now runs in plain shell, line by line, and the frame-rate cap refuses honestly on panels it cannot serve. RMX3430.
